Cute, but not totally accurate.  This could only happen to you if...

SPOILER ALERT


you have the teleport control intrinsic, and you specify a level
less than zero.

If you specify -10 or less, then...

	"You arrive in heaven."
	"Thou art early, but we'll admit thee."
	Died because you "went to heaven prematurely"

If you specify -9, then...

	"You feel deliriously happy."
	"(In fact, you're on Cloud 9!)"
	  [continue below]

If you specify -1 to -8 (or -9 from above), then...

	"You are now high above the clouds..."

	If you can levitate, ...
	    "You float gently down to earth."
	    You escaped the dungeon.
	or if you can fly, ...
	    "You fly down to earth."
	    You escape the dungeon, as well.
	otherwise ...
	    "Unfortunately, you don't know how to fly."
	    "You plummet a few thousand feet to your death."
	    Killed because you "teleported out of the dungeon
	      and fell to your death"

If you specify level 0, then you just exit the game because you
escaped from the dungeon.



